  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the length of closed pipe is $L_{1}$ and that of pipe is $L_{2}$. Fundamental frequency of closed pipe, $v_{1}=\\frac{v}{4 L_{1}}$\r\nand frequency of second harmonic of open pipe.\r\n$$\r\nv_{2}=2 \\times \\frac{v}{2 L_{2}}\r\n$$\r\nGiven,\r\n$$\r\nv_{1}=v_{2}\r\n$$\r\n$i, \\theta$\r\n$$\r\n\\frac{v}{4 L_{1}}=\\frac{2 v}{2 L_{2}} \\Rightarrow \\frac{L_{1}}{L_{2}}=\\frac{1}{4}\r\n$$",
    "image": null
